WEBVTT

00:13:29.679 --> 00:13:32.774
And she's become a remarkable spokeswoman.

00:13:33.121 --> 00:13:36.982
And she was offered contracts as a model,

00:13:37.006 --> 00:13:39.131
at which point
she teased me, when she said,

00:13:39.155 --> 00:13:41.700
"You know, I might have had
a better chance as a model

00:13:41.724 --> 00:13:43.432
if you'd made me six feet one."

00:13:43.456 --> 00:13:45.436
(Laughter)

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:46.611
Go figure.

00:13:48.038 --> 00:13:50.966
So this picture, I think, says it all.

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:53.081
It really says it all.

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:57.384
These are Nicole and brother Jonas,

00:13:57.408 --> 00:13:59.347
identical twin boys,